Package: ODDPubFromPure
Title: Download full-text article PDFs, convert to text, and run ODDPub for automated data sharing detection
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    c(
        person("Daniel", "Thedie", , "daniel.thedie@ed.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Using a list of publications extracted from the Pure system, download all available full-text PDFs; convert these PDFs to text; run ODDPub to detect open data sharing, and format the output into a PDF report.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports: 
    cli,
    dplyr,
    reticulate,
    rmarkdown
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
